# Hostinger SSH — only when needed

Use local SSH credentials **only when needed** — e.g. live site not reflecting changes, cache purge, inspecting/syncing server files, or fixing a failed deploy. Do **not** SSH on every edit, commit, or routine GitHub Actions deploy.

